# fx/twang: the Twang (the bow's effect, `fx twang`), P2c SLICE-ARMS 2026-10-23 (iteration 2: redrawn; the dotted
# ladder of iteration 1 read as a glitch). STYLE_P2 25.10, A3's three tones (A core, B body, C edge): a plus-shaped pop
# on the string's middle where the arrow left it, and a short dash flying out
# ahead of the bow in the arrow's line (its bright end leading). Facing down the arrow comes at the camera (a starburst
# at the nock); facing up it flies away (a dash rising beside the head). The string's own blur is the bow's
# `release` view. Drawn on the pivot at the release frame only (bw_rel); a2 (the follow) is empty.
# (FX wave 2 r1) redrawn as the string's vibration lines for the release frame (STYLE_P2 25.10): a 3 px core flash on the
# string at the nock, the body's long line ringing ahead of it and the edge's short lines either side; the dash and the
# starburst are gone (the arrow is the game's projectile). Facing down / up the string is face on: lines both sides.
# Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body adult
role fx twang
layer fx
anchor pivot
keys fx

# the pop on the string's middle (+9,-19) and the dash beyond the stave (facing left: the string at -9)
view R key a1 origin -7 23
|....B..
|....B.C
|C...B.C
|C.A.B.C
|C.A.B.C
|C.A.B.C
|C...B.C
|....B.C
|....B..

view R key a2 origin 0 0
|.

view L key a1 origin 13 23
|..B....
|C.B....
|C.B...C
|C.B.A.C
|C.B.A.C
|C.B.A.C
|C.B...C
|C.B....
|..B....

view L key a2 origin 0 0
|.

# facing down: the arrow comes at the camera, a starburst on the nock (+5,-17)
view D key a1 origin -3 19
|B...B
|B.A.B
|B.A.B
|B.A.B
|C...C

view D key a2 origin 0 0
|.

# facing up: the pop at the nock (-5,-15) and the dash rising away behind the head
view U key a1 origin 7 17
|B...B
|B.A.B
|B.A.B
|B.A.B
|C...C

view U key a2 origin 0 0
|.
